// 2. DTC B105564 de-maturation time: 0.3 seconds (wait 300ms)
// 3. Test verifies both active and passive DTC states
// 4. Tests night mode operation with key ON
// 5. Tests feedback signal plausibility detection
// 6. Tests DTC clearing and recovery

// Before running this test, ensure:
